#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:394
msgid ""
"In order to save space in the firmware, these constants are not included on "
"the :mod:`bluetooth` module. Add the ones that you need from the lists above"
" to your program."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi se uštedio prostor u ugrađenom programu (firmware), ove konstante "
"nisu uključene u modul :mod:`bluetooth`\\ . Dodajte one koje su vam potrebne"
" iz gornjih popisa u svoj program."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:399
msgid "Broadcaster Role (Advertiser)"
msgstr "Broadcaster uloga (oglašivač)"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:402
msgid ""
"Starts advertising at the specified interval (in microseconds). This "
"interval will be rounded down to the nearest 625us. To stop advertising, set"
" *interval_us* to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Započinje oglašavanje na navedenom intervalu (u mikrosekundama). Ovaj će "
"interval biti zaokružen prema dolje na najbližih 625us. Za zaustavljanje "
"oglašavanja postavite *interval_us* na ``None``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:406
msgid ""
"*adv_data* and *resp_data* can be any type that implements the buffer "
"protocol (e.g. ``bytes``, ``bytearray``, ``str``). *adv_data* is included in"
" all broadcasts, and *resp_data* is sent in reply to an active scan."
msgstr ""
"*adv_data* i *resp_data* mogu biti bilo koji tip koji implementira buffer "
"protokol (npr. ``bytes``\\ , ``bytearray``\\ , ``str``\\ ). *adv_data* je "
"uključen u sva odašiljanja, a *resp_data* se šalje kao odgovor na aktivno "
"skeniranje."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:410
msgid ""
"**Note:** if *adv_data* (or *resp_data*) is ``None``, then the data passed "
"to the previous call to ``gap_advertise`` will be reused. This allows a "
"broadcaster to resume advertising with just ``gap_advertise(interval_us)``. "
"To clear the advertising payload pass an empty ``bytes``, i.e. ``b''``."
msgstr ""
"**Napomena:** ako je *adv_data* (ili *resp_data*\\ ) jednak ``None``\\ , "
"tada će se ponovno upotrijebiti podaci proslijeđeni prethodnom pozivu "
"``gap_advertise``\\ . To omogućuje oglašivaču da nastavi oglašavanje samo s "
"``gap_advertise(interval_us)``\\ . Za brisanje korisnog tereta (payload) "
"oglašavanja proslijedite prazan ``bytes``\\ , tj. ``b''``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:416
msgid "Observer Role (Scanner)"
msgstr "Observer uloga (skener)"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:419
msgid ""
"Run a scan operation lasting for the specified duration (in milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"Pokreće operaciju skeniranja koja traje navedeno vrijeme (u milisekundama)."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:421
msgid "To scan indefinitely, set *duration_ms* to ``0``."
msgstr "Za neograničeno skeniranje postavite *duration_ms* na ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:423
msgid "To stop scanning, set *duration_ms* to ``None``."
msgstr "Za zaustavljanje skeniranja postavite *duration_ms* na ``None``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:425
msgid ""
"Use *interval_us* and *window_us* to optionally configure the duty cycle. "
"The scanner will run for *window_us* microseconds every *interval_us* "
"microseconds for a total of *duration_ms* milliseconds. The default interval"
" and window are 1.28 seconds and 11.25 milliseconds respectively (background"
" scanning)."
msgstr ""
"Koristite *interval_us* i *window_us* za opcionalno konfiguriranje radnog "
"ciklusa (duty cycle). Skener će raditi *window_us* mikrosekundi svakih "
"*interval_us* mikrosekundi, ukupno tijekom *duration_ms* milisekundi. Zadani"
" interval i prozor su 1,28 sekundi odnosno 11,25 milisekundi (skeniranje u "
"pozadini)."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:431
msgid ""
"For each scan result the ``_IRQ_SCAN_RESULT`` event will be raised, with "
"event data ``(addr_type, addr, adv_type, rssi, adv_data)``."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki rezultat skeniranja podići će se događaj ``_IRQ_SCAN_RESULT`` s "
"podacima događaja ``(addr_type, addr, adv_type, rssi, adv_data)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:434
msgid "``addr_type`` values indicate public or random addresses:"
msgstr "Vrijednosti ``addr_type`` označavaju javne ili nasumične adrese:"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:445
msgid "Public device address."
msgstr "Javna adresa uređaja."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:448
msgid ""
"Random address (either static, RPA, or NRPA; the type is encoded in the "
"address itself)."
msgstr ""
"Nasumična adresa (statička, RPA ili NRPA; tip je kodiran u samoj adresi)."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:451
msgid "``adv_type`` values correspond to the Bluetooth Specification:"
msgstr "Vrijednosti ``adv_type`` odgovaraju Bluetooth specifikaciji:"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:461
msgid "ADV_IND"
msgstr "ADV_IND"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:462
msgid "Connectable and scannable undirected advertising."
msgstr "Povezivo i skenirajuće neusmjereno oglašavanje."

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:464
msgid "ADV_DIRECT_IND"
msgstr "ADV_DIRECT_IND"

#: ../../library/bluetooth.rst:465
